 { Motivation To push yourself, there are at least two types of goals you can set yourself in every training session. Pace: During your first cycle, aim to solve at least as many exercises as in your previous session (assuming the exercises are of the same difficulty level) in the same amount of time. Score: If you decide to keep track of your scoring, then aim to increase your percentage as you go along while maintaining your pace. }  
