 { Summary Of Instructions Step 1 Cycle 1: Solve a set of exercises over approximately four weeks Step 2 Take at least the next day off Step 3 Cycle 2: Solve the same set, but within two weeks Step 4 Repeat steps 2-3, completing each cycle in half the number of days (rounded up where necessary) Step 5 The method is complete when the set has been solved in one day (or after seven cycles) Now there’s no more text to delay the exercises. Good luck and may the unconscious be with you! (At least after a while...) Hans Tikkanen & Axel Smith Lund, June 2018 } { _ }  
